# ── Source asset folders ──────────────────────────────────────
# The originals synced from SharePoint/OneDrive: about 1 GB.
# The site ships optimised derivatives in assets/downloads/ instead.
# These must never reach GitHub.
#
# The leading slash matters. Without it, "Logo/" matches ANY folder
# named Logo at any depth, and because git on Windows is
# case-insensitive that includes assets/downloads/logo/ — which is
# how the logo downloads silently went missing from the published
# site. Anchored to this folder only, it does the right thing.
/Images/
/Logo/

# ── Python ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ── OS noise ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
